From dbd83d05da240d82a4ad3472a9472614f6822d9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Damien Thenot <damien.thenot@vates.tech>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:06:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] DEBUG, DROP BEFORE MERGE: log scan and live migration timings

Temporary measurement patch, not meant to be merged: drop this commit
once the scan and live migration investigations are done.

Adds log lines with millisecond durations:
- `SCAN-TIMING`: steps of `LinstorSR.load`, `sr_scan` / `_load_vdis` and
  the `LinstorVolumeManager` init.
- `MIG-TIMING`: steps of `blktap2` activate / deactivate (including the
  VDI refresh through `VDI.from_uuid` / `SR.from_uuid`), the total of each
  `LinstorSR.load`, `lockVdi` round trips, the VDI load and
  `LinstorVDI.attach` / `detach`.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Damien Thenot <damien.thenot@vates.tech>
